      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, here goes nothing!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The surroundings are silent, save for the deafening roar of the waterfall. Asbestos climbs against the raging current, tugging at her rope, the top of which is swallowed by the splashing foam.\nIt is always the same—climbing towards unknown heights, or descending into unknown depths.\nShe knows that there is a stunning view at her destination, but not what difficulties that she might encounter on the way.\nIt could be a slip, a fall, wild beasts, snowstorms, or perhaps some disaster or challenge she could never imagine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(The current's too strong. I can't find my footing!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(There's a branch there!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Good, it's pretty solid. I should be able to avoid the currents by following it...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So slippery!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She knows how it feels to lose her balance in rapid currents, pushing her lungs to the limit in suffocating whirlpools.\nShe knows how it feels to keep climbing through the night after breaking her arm from a fall halfway up, just to catch a glimpse of the sunrise from the top.\nShe knows how it feels to slip and fall on a glacier, the ice chips ripping through her skin.\nBut she also remembers seeing the rays of the setting sun reflect upon the icy surface when she stood up again, accompanied by a sweet icy breeze.\nAt that moment, Asbestos no longer cared about her bleeding wounds. All the pain and suffering, all the hardship—it was all worth it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Cough* *Cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aye, that was one hell of a shower... good thing there's a gap here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I'm still alive! And almost there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Here we go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every time she gets up again, she is thinking the same thing.\nIt was bloody worth it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Half an hour later"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shy Archosauria",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_072",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*gasp*... *gasp*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frank Archosauria",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_073",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm exhausted..."
