    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frank Archosauria",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_073",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But your tail is really cool!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, for the love of—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just shut up and take in the view!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Archosauria are wet and muddy, with pieces of grass in their hair.\nA wind from the canyon blows the grass into the sky, until it disappears in the distance.\nThey see a sight they have never seen before—their own home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shy Archosauria",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_072",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look over there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Happy Archosauria",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow! Look at that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their hearts are filled with myriad emotions. Beautiful, stunning, spectacular—or perhaps something beyond what any word could describe. Just like the outsider who gazes at the view in fascination, their cries of joy echo through the canyon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Woo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wahoo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Asbestos",
      "speakerToken": "avg_378_asbest_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's beautiful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serious Archosauria",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Serious Archosauria",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want to sing."
    },
